# Third-party notices

yaml2cv includes the following third-party components. Their license
texts are in the `licenses/` directory next to this file. A running
instance shows them at `/licenses`.

| Component | Version | License | Files |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| envoy | 1.0.2 | Apache-2.0 | `licenses/envoy/LICENSE` |
| Erlang/OTP | 29.1.2 | Apache-2.0 | `licenses/erlang-otp/LICENSE` |
| typst-assets | 0.15.1 | GPL-3.0-or-later WITH Font-exception-2.0 | `licenses/typst-assets/NOTICE` |
| hpack_erl | 0.3.0 | see license file | `licenses/hpack_erl/LICENSE` |

